  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>關於：</strong><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\">這是基於 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/netherite-horse-armor-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Netherite 馬鎧模組</a></span>&nbsp;(<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tensorflow719/\" rel=\"nofollow\">TensorFlow719</a>) 的獨立移植版本，適用於 1.18-1.20 版本。<em>目前僅提供下方所列版本。</em><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800000\">Forge</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> - 1.18.2/1.19.2/1.19.3/1.19.4/1.20/1.20.1</span></span></strong></span><br><br>新增了<span style=\"color:#339\">獄髓馬鎧</span>，可抵禦<span style=\"color:#930\">火焰與岩漿</span>：<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yktrxRm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"685\" height=\"685\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>你可以透過鍛造獲得，或在<span style=\"color:#800000\">堡壘遺蹟馬廄儲物箱</span>中找到。<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BcBlBVg.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"689\" height=\"278\"></span></span></span><br><br>同時保留原始模組的<span style=\"color:#339\">進度<span style=\"color:#000\">，現在為了統一性而改為<span style=\"color:#f9c\">挑戰</span>類別。：</span></span>)<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fLPJqKD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"636\" height=\"125\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">致謝：<br></span></strong></span>原始模組作者 @TensorFlow719。材質由我製作。<br>歡迎用於整合包。<br><br>採用 GNU GPLv3 授權</p>",
